WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.190
Everyone knows video games are the best but we should acknowledge that sometimes

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:08.900
They're frustrating! These are the 50 most frustrating moments in video games.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:12.040
Thinking you're done with a maze but then realizing you missed a dot.

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:14.920
Falling .2 seconds short of getting your "S" license.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:18.320
This jump which is the hardest in the game, Missions where you pilot an RC helicopter

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:22.770
Memorizing the fatality, practicing the fatality, beating your friend and messing up the fatality,

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:26.690
Beating a level with just two birds and then for some reason the game only gives you two stars

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:28.520
When you just can't get a line piece. 

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:31.400
Insta-kill lasers that go *laser sound effect*

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:36.890
Spending hours breading a golden Chokabo and realizing you just spent hours breading chokabos.

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:40.300
What's worse, beating 3 of the elite 4 losing to the fourth then having to start the whole thing over

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:43.440
Or when you walk into a cave and there's a million fucking zubats

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:48.670
Protecting Natalia when she's hacking, getting knocked out by Mike Tyson, Just dropping a combo in Tony hawk. 

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:54.690
Failing during that last solo in Green Grass and High Tide, a song that by the way is ten minutes long, turret levels, TURRET LEVELS

00:00:54.690 --> 00:01:01.490
Some jerk camping the spawn point, getting stuck on a puzzle, giving up, looking up the solution on youtube then realizing the tutorial is hosted by a 9 year old

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:03.590
Being the new guy on a server full of people who have been playing for years

00:01:03.590 --> 00:01:09.080
Putting a quarter into an old game and only then remembering that pretty much all old games are impossible. 

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:13.790
Winning rainbow mode only to get blueshelled into oblivion, trying to beat whizzpig, trying to get a nintendo game working

00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:16.930
Games designed to be frustrating doesn't make them less frustrating

00:01:16.930 --> 00:01:20.070
The I just can't wait to be king level, don't laugh, it's impossible

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:23.470
Basically every puzzle in every adventure game, but especially this desert

00:01:23.670 --> 00:01:28.710
Game wrecking bugs, not being able to get a riddle trophy that's behind the fence even though, oh, I don't know, you're Batman

00:01:28.710 --> 00:01:34.200
Any level with these Medusa heads, this barrel in carnival Night Zone, whenever the music sped up because you were running out of air in an underwater level. 

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:38.390
This underwater level, all underwater levels, All levels where you have to escort someone

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:41.790
Tripping on a staircase and turning yourself into stone. Just trust me on this one

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:45.980
When you're playing something multiplayer online and your family or I don't know, whoever calls, and you can't pause the game

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:48.330
When a brand new PC game won't work on your brand new PC

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:51.210
Having to climb a ladder in any first person shooter, trippy dream sequences,

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:55.130
When your friend has full health and you have no health and he eats the turkey anyway

00:01:55.270 --> 00:02:01.150
This dog's laugh, games that don't have passwords or save systems, saving your game the moment before something stupid you can't avoid happens

00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:05.080
accidentally hitting no in a Nintendo game when a character asks if you understood all that, the water temple, 

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:09.530
When you get a new game and can't even figure the first thing you're supposed to do, the turbo tunnel what you think I forgot it?

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:15.020
The great maze, this Genesis game that a one point requires you physically get up and reset the system

00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:18.160
In order to proceed, yes this is a real idea someone once had

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:23.920
But the absolute most frustrating part in all of video games isn't when your trying to get to the next level or unlock the next jetpack or whatever it is.

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:30.720
It's when you realize there isn't enough time for all the video games that you want to play. 

00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:36.480
I'm just kidding. Let's play video games all the time. *popping sound*

